request.description:
Runs a Taiga sync for the integration named by `taigaIntegrationId`. Prerequisites on the integration doc: provider="taiga", a Taiga API token stored as `token`, repository_name=project slug, project_id=linked project.

Fetches from https://api.taiga.io/api/v1:
- GET /milestones?project_id={id}
- GET /user_stories?project_id={id}
- GET /tasks?project_id={id}
- GET /sprints?project_id={id}

Expected 200:
{ "status": true, "status_message": "Sync complete.", "data_sets": { "status": "success", "items_synced": { "work_items": 30, "sprints": 3, "tasks": 45, "sprint_summaries": 3, "task_statuses": 5, "total": 86 } } }
